A Mac on an open network, for `doctor`: every probe answers over the NIC (Google
204, GitHub and Baidu 200, the API 200), and through rowt's port too — so the
only reachability flag is OPEN_INTERNET. The answers are keyed by curl's whole
argv (the recorder's most specific key), because the same URL is asked over the
NIC and through the proxy and the two must be answerable apart.
